<title>ITALY: Italy's Sorin to fully incorporate units.</title>
<headline>Italy's Sorin to fully incorporate units.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's bio-medical group Sorin Biomedica on Monday said it has decided to incorporate to a 100 percent level its Dideco, Sorin Biomedica Cardio and Sorin Biomedica Diagnostic units.</p>
<p>Sorin is controlled by Snia BPD which in turn is controlled by Fiat SpA.</p>
<p>The company said it has called a shareholders meeting to approve the full incorporation on April 21, with further days scheduled for April 29 and April 30 if needed.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +329 66129502</p>
